# Local credential / environment dumps that must never reach the remote.
# These hold Windows Credential Manager target names, account identifiers and
# token labels for Roblox Studio, Microsoft, GitHub and Mojang (labels only --
# no secret values). Verified absent from origin/main and HEAD, so nothing is
# public today. They ARE reachable from the local refs/cline/checkpoints/* refs,
# so never push with `--all` / `--mirror` or copy .git/ off this machine.
